  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Heavy Duty Riggers Belt is a perfect match for our BDU tactical pants. Made from durable polypropylene material, these heavy duty belts easily withstand field demands and harsh outdoor conditions. Featuring a fully adjustable design, the riggers belt ensures a comfortable fit. The metal cargo buckle with hook and loop closure provides secure fastening. With a width of 1.25 inches, this tactical belt offers robust support. Available in various sizes, including Small (S), Medium (M), Large (L), Extra-Large (XL), and 2XL, the tactical belt accommodates different waist sizes.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Sizing of military style rigger belts ia as follows:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Small (S) 27\" - 31\"</li>\n<li>Medium (M) 31\" - 35\"</li>\n<li>Large (L) 35\" - 39\"</li>\n<li>X- Large (XL) 39\" - 43\"</li>\n<li>2XL 43\"- 47\"</li>\n</ul>",
